<title>JAPAN: Sakura Bank - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sakura Bank - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     1.28 trln	 vs	    1.17 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  132.04		vs	  160.81</p>
<p> Current	     51.25		vs	   38.04</p>
<p> Net		   49.49		vs	   15.81</p>
<p> EPS		   14.13 yen	  vs	    4.37 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   3.42 billion	  vs	3.42 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.25 yen	  vs	    4.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sakura Bank Ltd is a commercial bank.</p>
